Subject: [PATCH] seo: extensionless canonicals/links/sitemap, keyword H1s, alt
 text, case-study schema

- canonical + og:url on all 25 pages now point to the served
  extensionless URL instead of .html (which 301-redirects)
- all internal href values converted to extensionless (no redirect hop)
- sitemap.xml rewritten to final URLs (25 entries)
- URLs inside JSON-LD (mainEntityOfPage, breadcrumbs) de-.html'd
- keyword-bearing H1s on home, about, blog, services, work, contact;
  slogans demoted to divs so the design is unchanged
- 7 case-study pages given descriptive H1 subtitles + Article schema
- 20 client logos given real brand alt text (was 'Client Logo 1..21')
